1.What is Deep Learning? Why is it considered a subset of Machine Learning?
Deep Learning is a subset of Machine Learning that uses Artifical Neural Networks with many layers.
This multiple layers help the system learn highly complex patterns.
It is consider a subset of because it builds on ML priciples but scales them with deeper architectures.

